OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of murdering
OL,4,A13-week-old baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering his girlfriend's 13-week-old
OL,8,Fbaby in Kent.
OL,10,FHunter Hodges suffered a "severe direct
OL,11,Fimpact" to the head akin to that seen
OL,12,Fin "a high-speed motorcycle collision
OL,13,For a multi-level fall", Canterbury
OL,14,FCrown Court heard.
OL,16,FTyla Wharmby was caring for the baby
OL,17,Fovernight while his partner, Shannon
OL,18,FHodges, slept. He is not Hunter's
OL,19,Fbiological father.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
