OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of murdering
OL,4,A13-week-old baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 24-year-old man, of Prestedge
OL,7,FAvenue in Ramsgate, had pleaded not
OL,8,Fguilty to murder and grievous bodily
OL,9,Fharm with intent, but was found guilty
OL,10,Fof both offences on Thursday.
